Pinboard 0.3:

* A narrow drawing dock whose groups open flyouts with tools, colors and a size slider; new Bezier curve and polygon tools.
* The navigation menu sits in the bottom center; its zoom "Lupe" can filter the board by words or a filter expression.
* Fullscreen keeps TiddlyWiki's own dialogs on top and keeps the view centered.
* A background picture can stay fixed to the view or lie on the board.
* The frame tool moved into the presentation path panel.
